        "sid": "2CO 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū batogwa, īkī tūlī na wisagījiwa wenūbū, twiyeejagi twīnge ū mu būsoso wa mīlī nū wa mu moyo; tūbūshikīlīje ū wela mu logohano lwa ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būyegi bo ng'wa Paulo kūlwa Bakolinto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Galīhagi ū mung'holò jing'we mutwanukūle, nguno tūtaalī kūng'hūba munhū nūūlū ūmò, tūtaalī kūnemba nūūlū ni kūng'wikolosha ose ose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwenūyū natūgūhayaga kūlwa koolecha gīkī mulī babūbi, nguno namalaga kūhaya gīkī mulīmo ū mung'holò jise. Nīyo a bise tūmalīīlile gete ū kūbiza hamò ning'we mu yose; ībize mu kūcha nūūlū mu būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalī nayo mingī ī ya kūninha kūmusanya, na hangī nakwikumīlījaga no kūlwa nguno ying'we a bing'we. Nalī na kūlūngūjiwa kūtaale no, ū būyegi bone būkūseesekelaga nūūlū aho tūlī mu kūluhiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ng'hana aho twashika Makedonia ī mibīlī yise ītifuulile nūūlū hado, twaluhiagwa hose hose; ī hanze twalī na wilwisha, nū mu gatī twalī na booba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Mulungu ū Shiguna baluhi, akatūlūngūja aho wiza ū Tito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo ītī kūlwa nguno akiza dūhū, alīyo nī nguno ya būlūngūjiwa ūbo akanukūla aho walī kū bing'we; nguno akatūwīla gīt'ūmo būlī ū būkomeezu wing'we. Ūtūsomboolela nī ya būpīna wing'we, pyī nī ya būjangīīzu wing'we ūbo mulī nabo kūlwa nguno yane. Pyī ī yose yenīyo īkaniyeja hataale no ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū īkī nakamupīnīhaja ū mu nyalūba yane, alīyo nahene ī haha natūsunduhalaga, (gwike ī chene nakasunduhala a makanza gene) nguno nalībona ī nyalūba yenīyo ng'hana īkamupīnīhaja, alīyo ng'wikanza iguhī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha nalī na būyegi, ītī kūlwa nguno īkī mukapīnīhala, alīyo kūlwa nguno mukapīnīhala kūshisha ng'ūgalūcha ī nhūngwa. Mutapandīkile makoye gose gose ū kūfuma ū kū bise, nguno mukapīnīhala gīt'ūmo Mulungu atogelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būpīna ūbo būhayiwe na Mulungu būkenhaga kūgalūka na kwingīla mu būpanga, būtazoobaajaga; alīyo ū būpīna bo mu sī, ū wene būkenhaga icha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ī haha ambū mulībona īyo bong'wītīlile ū būpīna ūbo Mulungu abūhayile? Mulībona gīkī ng'wīdeebile ī ng'hana, nū wigunanhi, nū būhūbi ng'wabūbonile, nū logohano ng'walūpandīkile, nū būtogwa ū bo ng'hana, nū būjangīīzu mu kwīta yawiza, nū gwa kūbinha nsango a bahūbi! Ū mu yose yenīyī ng'wiyoolekije kūbiza beela mu būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūūlū īkī nakang'wandīkīla, yalī ītī kūlwa nguno ya ng'hūbi nūūlū ū ng'hūwa dūhū. Alīyo twalī tūtogilwe būmanīke ū būkalalwa wing'we ūbo mulī nabo kūlwa nguno yise; nguno h'ūmo tūkang'wiganikīlaga a bing'we ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lūūlū twalūngūjiwe no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būyegi kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Tito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī a higūlya ya kūlūngūjiwa kwise, tūlī na būyegi būtaale no, nguno ū Tito alī na būyegi īkī pye a bose mukagwifuuja ū moyo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natagookile nūūlū īkī naalī nang'wīla ī mihayo ying'we mu kwikumīlīja; nguno gīt'ūmo yalī ya ng'hana pyī ī mihayo īyo tūkamuwīla, nū kwikumīlīja kwise ū kūlī Tito kwabizile kwa ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū owizūkwa ū wigwi wing'we nū mumo mukang'wanukūlīla, ng'wikūjo na logohano, ū būtogwa bokwe ū kū bing'we būkūbīlīlaga hataale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nū nene nalī na būyegi, nguno nadūgije kūmusanya mu yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
